    <item>
      <title>🎃 Things that should ACTUALLY scare you during a Web3 job search: 🚩 A recruiter </title>
      <link>https://t.me/cryptojobslist/11672</link>
      <description>&lt;div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"&gt;&lt;tg-emoji emoji-id="5470018168627943333"&gt;&lt;i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8E83.png')"&gt;&lt;b&gt;🎃&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/tg-emoji&gt; &lt;b&gt;Things that should ACTUALLY scare you during a Web3 job search:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9AA9.png')"&gt;&lt;b&gt;🚩&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; A recruiter asking you to pay a fee to secure a job&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9AA9.png')"&gt;&lt;b&gt;🚩&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Being rushed into private conversations with someone whose identity you can't verify&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9AA9.png')"&gt;&lt;b&gt;🚩&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Being asked to download unfamiliar files or software as part of an interview&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9AA9.png')"&gt;&lt;b&gt;🚩&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Anyone requesting your wallet's seed phrase or private keys&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9AA9.png')"&gt;&lt;b&gt;🚩&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; A company with no verifiable online presence&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9AA9.png')"&gt;&lt;b&gt;🚩&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Pressure to make immediate decisions involving money or personal information&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;A rejection isn't the scariest thing that can happen during a job search.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;A fake opportunity is.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Before sharing sensitive information, downloading files or connecting your wallet, take a moment to verify who you're dealing with.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Stay safe out there, job hunters. &lt;i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F91BB.png')"&gt;&lt;b&gt;👻&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/cryptojobslist/11672</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 09:51:58 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
